        <mxCell id="constraints" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Lifecycle and integrity rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;• Role credentials are plain text for this course demo only.&lt;br&gt;• Selecting a login role determines which subtype credentials are checked.&lt;br&gt;• Boolean values CHECK: 0 or 1; route origin and destination must differ.&lt;br&gt;• Flight arrival must be after departure; fares must be non-negative.&lt;br&gt;• Flight status: SCHEDULED, CANCELLED, or COMPLETED.&lt;br&gt;• Reservation status: CONFIRMED or CANCELLED.&lt;br&gt;• Partial UQ index: (flight_id, seat_id) WHERE reservation status = CONFIRMED.&lt;br&gt;• A reservation seat must belong to the aircraft assigned to its flight.&lt;br&gt;• Cancelling a flight and its confirmed reservations is one transaction.&lt;br&gt;• Foreign keys use ON DELETE RESTRICT; normal removal uses cancel/deactivate.&lt;br&gt;• Hard deletion is permitted only for unused records entered by mistake." vertex="1">
